</style>
<h2>Asobi Review 0.9 (build 837)</h2>
<ul>
<li>The <b>Session</b> menu is now <b>Share</b>: <b>Share This Review&#8230;</b> (&#8679;&#8984;R) to join a review from a link or on your network, <b>Review Manager&#8230;</b>, <b>Open Invite File&#8230;</b>, and <b>Leave This Review</b> when you are done.</li>
<li>Plain words in the Share This Review window: <b>Join</b>, <b>Leave</b>, one <i>passphrase</i> everywhere, connections <i>over the internet</i> or <i>on this network</i>, and a progress line that reads like a sentence.</li>
<li>The guide uses the new names.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
